\pard\sb200\sa100\b\fs25 6. Template 1 vs Template 2\b0\par
\pard\li180\sa75\fs18 SRS Template 1  |  SRS Template 2\b0\par
\pard\li180\sa75\fs18 Full-stack BA \u8594? HLD \u8594? UI \u8594? backend implementation  |  Formal specification organized by quality categories\b0\par
\pard\li180\sa75\fs18 CJM, BPMN, AS-IS/TO-BE, C4, ER, API and MQ  |  Functional, usability, reliability, performance, supportability\b0\par
